	<section id="divInfoAdv9b9f9afd-f9a7-4bd8-9ed9-7c4fc4708ad0" class="widget widgetInfoAdvanced skin72 widgetOptionSet5 wide" data-modulewidgettype="infoAdv" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}' data-elementquerymatch='matchMultiColumn' data-elementqueryunmatch='unmatchMultiColumn' aria-labelledby="header9b9f9afd-f9a7-4bd8-9ed9-7c4fc4708ad0">
			<header class="widgetHeader" id="header9b9f9afd-f9a7-4bd8-9ed9-7c4fc4708ad0">
		<div class="">
					<h3 >Building and wildfire codes take effect this summer</h3>
								</div>
	</header>
	<div class="widgetBody  cpGrid cpGrid1 ">
		<div class="row  wide">
					<div class="col col1 first last">
						<ol class="pageStyles semanticList">

<li class="InfoAdvanced widgetItem fr-view">
	<p>Building Codes - Adopted amendments to the Town of Castle Rock Building Codes took effect June 30, 2026. The 2025 Colorado Wildfire Resiliency Code took effect July 1, 2026.</p>
</li>						</ol>
					</div>
