		<div class="row outer wide"><!--
--><div class="outer col col24 first last" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="903c99bc-8985-4a5a-9e30-1f3e702d86fa">				
	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last id01a50581-89ce-4f13-9ef2-4b2e156947ef" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="01a50581-89ce-4f13-9ef2-4b2e156947ef">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor0385f01f-50b6-439a-b950-d7d7bf2a7d79" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 class="subhead1 ">Building codes promote safety</h2><p>The Town of Castle Rock has adopted the following building and fire codes for all new permit submittals.</p><p>See Title 15 of the <a href="https://www.municode.com/library/co/castle_rock/codes/municipal_code" target="_self">Municipal Code</a> for any specific exceptions to these codes adopted by the Town of Castle Rock.</p><ul><li>2024 International Building Code</li><li>2024 International Residential Code</li><li>2024 International Plumbing Code</li><li>2024 International Mechanical Code</li><li>2021 International Energy Conservation Code</li><li>2024 International Fuel Gas Code</li><li>2024 International Fire Code</li><li>2024 International Existing Building Code</li><li>2024 International Swimming Pool and Spa Code</li><li>2017 ANSI A117.1</li><li>1997 Uniform Code for the Abatement of Dangerous Buildings</li><li>2026 National Electrical Code</li><li>ASME A17.1 2022 Elevator Code</li><li>ASME A18.1 2020 Safety Standard for Platform Lifts and Stairway Chairlifts</li><li>ASME A17.3 2023 Safety Code for Existing Elevators and Escalators</li><li>ASCE 21, Parts 1 through 4 Automated People Mover Standards</li><li>2025 Colorado Wildfire Resiliency Code</li><li>Model Colorado Electric Ready and Solar Ready Code</li></ul><p>The subject matter of the codes concerns regulations to provide minimum standards to safeguard life or limb, property and public welfare by regulating and controlling:</p><ul><li>Design</li><li>Construction and quality of materials</li><li>Use and Occupancy</li><li>Location and maintenance of all buildings, structures, plumbing systems and mechanical systems in the Town</li></ul>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + '0385f01f-50b6-439a-b950-d7d7bf2a7d79'));
	});
</script>
</div>
